  "create_objective": "Create a persistent cross-task objective only when the current user asks for ongoing work or monitoring. Use an actual current canonical user_input anchor. agent_proposal remains paused until the user confirms. Pick report_only for notification requests, propose for approval before work, act only for explicit current authorization to fix directly. Use typed watches and factual success signals; max auto sessions is three per day. Never set runtime state or confirmation fields.",
